    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d187">

                <pb facs="0229" n="219" sameAs="frus:frus1943v01/pg219"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.48 Refugees/4763: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in the United
                        Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-11-17">November 17,
                        1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>7283. With reference to your 7867 November 11, Department concurs in procedure
                    for approval of minutes of Executive Committee as outlined in despatch 12063,
                    November 4.<anchor n="90" xml:id="d187-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>Concerning relations between IGC and UNRRA Department will delay instructions in
                    view of discussions taking place at Atlantic City Conference.</p>
                <p>We believe it inadvisable for IGC representative to attend Atlantic City
                    Conference at this time. Matter has been discussed with Mr. Myron Taylor who
                    concurs in this view.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
